~ start

Aunt Stephanie: Well, there's my favorite trouble. What do you need, Hun?
- Ask about repairs.
	do repairs_started = station.begin_repairs(player)
	if repairs_started
		Aunt Stephanie: Family doesn't pay here, Hun, don't insult me by asking twice. Crew's already on your hull -- sit tight.
	else
		Aunt Stephanie: Hun, I can't fix what I can't touch. Get that ship into my dock, then we'll talk.
	=> start
- You look like something's bugging you. [if not story.has_flag("todd_mission_accepted") /]
	do story.set_flag("todd_mission_accepted")
	do missions.start_mission_by_id("check_on_todd")
	Aunt Stephanie: It's your cousin Todd. Three weeks, not one call. Even for him that's a new record. It's probably nothing -- probably broke his antenna again and can't be bothered -- but I want eyes on him, Hun. Just in case.
	Aunt Stephanie: Head out to the Slag Bay field -- his place is parked in there somewhere. If you can't raise him, ask the neighbors; those folks see everything. And tell that boy his aunt says to CALL.
	=> start
- Any word from Todd? [if story.has_flag("todd_mission_accepted") /]
	Aunt Stephanie: Not a peep -- which means you still owe me a flyby, Hun. Slag Bay field. Go.
	=> start
- Goodbye.
	=> END
